### 1. GET /hello/admin as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET /hello/admin as USER (user:user) — 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user:user
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. GET /hello/admin as SUPERADMIN (superadmin:superadmin) — 403 Forbidden (only ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic superadmin:superadmin
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. GET /hello/user as USER (user:user) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/user
Authorization: Basic user:user
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. GET /hello/user as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 403 Forbidden (only USER)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. GET /hello/man as USER (user:user) — 200 OK (allowed: USER, ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/man
Authorization: Basic user:user
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. GET /hello/man as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 200 OK (allowed: USER, ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/man
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. GET /hello/man as SUPERADMIN (superadmin:superadmin) — 403 Forbidden (only USER, ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/man
Authorization: Basic superadmin:superadmin
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. GET /hello/superadmin as SUPERADMIN (superadmin:superadmin) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic superadmin:superadmin
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. GET /hello/superadmin as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 403 Forbidden (only SUPERADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. GET /hello/unknown as USER (user:user) — 200 OK (any authenticated role)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/unknown
Authorization: Basic user:user
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. GET /hello/unknown as SUPERADMIN (superadmin:superadmin) — 200 OK (any authenticated role)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/hello/unknown
Authorization: Basic superadmin:superadmin
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. GET All Books as USER (user:user) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic user:user
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. GET Book by ID=2 as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 15. CREATE Book as USER (user:user) — 403 Forbidden (requires ADMIN or SUPERADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic user:user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Forbidden Book by User",
  "author": "Regular User",
  "price": 25.00
}

###

### 16. CREATE Book as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 200 OK (allowed: ADMIN, SUPERADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Zero Trust Networks",
  "author": "Evan Gilman, Doug Barth",
  "description": "Building Secure Systems in Untrusted Networks",
  "price": 45.00,
  "published_year": 2017
}

###

### 17. UPDATE Book by ID=2 as USER (user:user) — 403 Forbidden (requires ADMIN or SUPERADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Basic user:user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Forbidden Update by User",
  "price": 10.00
}

###

### 18. UPDATE Book by ID=2 as SUPERADMIN (superadmin:superadmin) — 200 OK (allowed: ADMIN, SUPERADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Basic superadmin:superadmin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "The Web Application Hacker's Handbook (2nd Edition)",
  "price": 54.99
}

###

### 19. DELETE Book by ID=1 as ADMIN (admin:admin) — 403 Forbidden (requires SUPERADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 20. DELETE Book by ID=1 as SUPERADMIN (superadmin:superadmin) — 200 OK (allowed only: SUPERADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic superadmin:superadmin
Accept: application/json

###
